---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';

export const prerender = true;
---

<Layout title="Cloth - Soft Goods - DES4800" description="Fabric types and material choices for soft-goods design.">
  <article class="post-detail">
    <header class="post-header">
      <a href="/soft-goods/" class="back-link">← Back to Soft Goods</a>
      <h1>Cloth</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="post-content">
      <p>
        Cloth is the structural base of soft goods. Fiber content, weave or knit structure, weight, and grain determine
        how a material drapes, sews, wears, and holds form. This page will expand with studio guidance for selecting and
        preparing fabrics for product prototypes.
      </p>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
